From 7bd0ff543d3b199d8b1acbb3735bac27a7df885d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 12:18:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] v2.2.5: privacy + polish batch (5 backlog items) - mask Wi-Fi
 key, de-cloud icons, full-screen loader, offline device names, i18n residuals

- SDN reconnect card: mask the plaintext Wi-Fi key. state.js showWlHintContainer()
  renders "<#Network_key#>: <b>KEY</b>" per band as a reconnect hint to a Wi-Fi admin;
  a new sdn.js-local reaperMaskWlHintKey() replaces the rendered key with dots at all 12
  apply call sites. The shared state.js body (also used by mlo/Advanced_VLAN/Roaming) is
  untouched. (backlog option ii)

- De-cloud the 3 remaining ASUS-CDN icon fetches (extends the v2.2.0 fix): httpApi.js
  checkCloudModelIcon() now returns the no-icon callback; index.asp client-detail uses the
  bundled type icon; AdaptiveQoS_Bandwidth_Monitor.asp keeps the bundled per-app icon. No
  browser fetch to nw-dlcdnet.asus.com for device/model/app icons remains.

- Loading/percent/reboot overlay now covers the whole screen: raised the UI4 shadow loader
  (popup.js .popup_bg, was z 2000, below the shell menu) and the legacy #Loading overlay
  (UI4 index_style.css .popup_bg, was z 9999) above all shell chrome so the nav/header are
  not clickable during an apply/reboot.

- Traffic Analyzer history: resolve OFFLINE device names. Reaper_Traffic.asp now seeds its
  name map from custom_clientlist (the persistent master, which retains named offline
  devices) so 24h/week/month rows show the name instead of a bare IP/MAC; the live
  networkmap list still overrides for online devices. (closes Client ID + month-view items)

- i18n residuals: tokenize the Connections Quick Look labels in Reaper_Conn.asp (reuse
  Clientlist_device / IPConnection_VSList_Internal|External; new RCON_36-40 for
  State/Scope/Quick Look/Advanced/Pause) and complete RADV_01 (was truncated) + translate
  RWDN_55 (was English-seeded) across all 24 non-EN dicts. 25 real dicts lockstep at 6254.

BE96U MCP built (MAKE_EXIT=0), dicts regenerated + validated, shipped for owner testing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
